nTotal sum: 1,226,000 +1,101 = 1,227,101. Yep, same result. So definitely the answer is correct.\n\nI think that's thorough enough. The step-by-step addition was done correctly initially, and cross-verified with two different methods. So confident that's the right answer.\n</think>\n\n",
