ns:5+3=8 +1=9. No carry.\n\nHundreds:8 (from first) +1 (from second) =9. No carry.\n\nThousands:9 (first) +6 (second) =15. So 5, carryover 1.\n\nTen thousands:7 (first) +3 (second) =10, plus 1 carried is 11. So write 1 and carryover 1.\n\nHundred thousands:8 +9 =17 plus 1 carried is 18. .\n\nSo putting all together: 1 (from the million place) 8 (hundred thousands), 1 (ten thousands), 5 (thousands), 9 (hundreds),9 (tens),6 (ones)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
