 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n3. **Hundreds place**: 6 + 3 = 9 + 1 (carryover) = 10. Write down 0, carry over 1.\n4. **Thousands place**: 2 + 2 = 4 + 1 (carryover) = 5. Write down 5.\n5. **Ten-thousands place**: 5 + 9 = 14. Write down 4, carry over 1.\n6. **Hundred-thousands place**: 3 + 9 = 12 + 1 (carryover) = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n7. **Millions place**: The carryover 1 is written down.\n\nPutting all the digits together, the result is 1,345,035.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n  \\ 352696 \\\\\n+ 992339 \\\\\n\\hline\n 1345035 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{1345035}.", ''] 20%|##        | 101/500 [54:34<4:22:09, 39.42s/it]
