\n5. Ten thousands place:5 +5 =10 +1 =11 \u2192 write 1, carryover1.\n\n6. Hundred thousands place:7 +8 =15 +1 =16 \u2192 write 6, carryover1.\n\n7. Millions place: the carryover1 is written there.\n\nSo putting all together: 1,618,714.\n\nTherefore, the answer is correct.\n\nI think that's all. The key steps are adding each column, carrying over when the sum exceeds 9, and making sure to include the final carryover into the millions place.\n</think>\n\n",
