s the carried 1 is 11. Write 1, carry over 1.\n3. Hundreds place: 2 + 0 = 2, plus 1 is 3. Write 3.\n4. Thousands place: 9 + 5 = 14. Write 4, carry over 1.\n5. Ten-thousands place: 1 + 3 = 4, plus 1 is 5. Write 5.\n6. Hundred-thousands place: 3 + 7 = 10. Write 0 here and carry over 1 to the millions place.\n7. Millions place: The carried 1. So we add a 1 at the beginning.\n\nPutting all digits together: 1 (millions), 0 (hundred-thousands), 5 (ten-thousands), 4 (thousands), 3 (hundreds), 1 (tens), 5 (ones). So 1,054,315.\n\nThat should be the correct breakdown. Alright, time to format it into the template properly.\n</think>\n\n",
