operly.\n\nWait, perhaps I should line them up properly:.\n\n  659,996.\n+528,053.\n----------.\nLet's break it down digit by digit:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\nOnes: 6 + 3 = 9 ✔️.\nTens: 9 +5 =14 → 4 carryover 1 ✔️.\nHundreds: 9 (from first number) +0 (second) +1 carried =10 → 0 carryover 1 ✔️.\nThousands: 9 (first) +8 (second) +1 carried =18 → 8 carryover 1 ✔️.\nTen-thousands: 5 (first) +2 (second) +1 carried =8 ✔️.\nHundred-thousands: 6 +5 =11 ✔️</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
