t carried-over 1 becomes the digit in the millions place.\n\nPutting all the digits together: 1 (million), 0 (hundred thousands), 6 (ten thousands), 4 (thousands), 8 (hundreds), 6 (tens), and 6 (ones)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
