sands place: 7 + 6 + 1 (carryover) = 14. Write down 4, carry over 1.\n6. The hundred thousands place: 8 + 2 + 1 (carryover) = 11. Write down 1, carry over 1.\n7. The millions place: The carried over 1 is written here.\n\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\boxed{1145866}.", '']
