nes place: 6 +7 =13, correct. Carryover 1.\n\nTens:8+7+1=16, yes. 6 and carryover 1.\n\nHundreds:4+9+1=14, so 4 and carryover 1.\n\nThousands:3+2=5 plus 1 is 6. No carryover.\n\nTen thousands:4+0=4.\n\nHundred thousands:7+8=15. So 5 here and carryover 1 to millions, which becomes 1</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
