ing all these results, we get the final sum as 1,280,649.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n  \\quad 940775 \\\\\n+ \\quad 339874 \\\\\n\\hline\n  1280649 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the sum of 940775 and 339874 is \\(\\boxed{1280649}\\).",
